  "definitions": [
    "Each period is one 28-day close. P66 follows restoration at P65. The four observed flows do not describe the intervening years.",
    "Household fulfilled orders count food purchased and delivered during that close. Consumed units may come from opening stocks. US counties, foreign counterparts and US dependencies are disjoint.",
    "US county public accounts exclude US dependencies and foreign public accounts. Operating grants, household income support and agency appropriations are distinct allocation purposes. Taxes are measured at the receiving public account.",
    "Trade directions follow the goods. Each matched recurring order requires delivery, realization and buyer-escrow payment at the original unit price to the supplier. Dependencies are outside this trade boundary. Counts are orders settled in that close.",
    "A zero settlement or budget flow has no matching positive posting. A missing receipt group or measurement is null (unobserved). Currency fields ending in _micros are integer strings, with 1,000,000 per dollar."
  ],
